// EXPECT_COMPILE_ERROR [E_NESTING_TOO_DEEP] nesting is deeper than 512 levels
// Registry 221.1 #800: before this limit the parser rode the native stack
// down and DIED on it -- `thread 'nova-check-0' has overflowed its stack`,
// with no file, no line and no `E_*`. Measured 2026-08-29 (each probe in its
// OWN directory, because `nova check` pulls a folder in as a module):
// nested parens 2000 ok / 2500 dead, nested `if` 500 ok / 1810 dead, value
// blocks 1810 dead, deterministic 3/3. A crash with no diagnostic is the
// first thing an outsider feeding the compiler generated code would see, and
// `novac` has had this exact standard at rank CORE since plan 274 while the
// oracle had no fuzzing at all.
//
// 600 nested parens: above the 512 limit, below the ~2500 where the stack
// used to die -- so this fixture proves the DIAGNOSTIC, not the crash.
module neg.m800_nesting_depth_neg

